ang:line071","text":"晉巴東監軍徐胤率水軍詣建平，荊州刺史楊肇至西陵。抗令張咸固守其城；公安督孫遵巡南岸御祜；水軍督留慮、鎮西將軍朱琬拒胤。身率三軍，憑圍對肇。將軍朱喬、營都督俞贊亡詣肇。抗曰：「贊軍中舊吏，知吾虛實者，吾常慮夷兵素不簡練，若敵攻圍，必先此處。」即夜易夷民，皆以舊將充之。明日，肇果攻故夷兵處，抗命旋軍擊之，矢石雨下，肇眾傷死者相屬。肇至經月。計屈夜遁。抗欲追之，而慮闡畜力項領，伺視間隙，兵不足分，於是但鳴鼓戒眾，若將追者。肇眾兇懼，悉解甲挺走，抗使輕兵躡之，肇大破敗，祜等皆引軍還。抗遂陷西陵城，誅夷闡族及其大將吏，自此以下，所請赦者數萬口。修治城圍，東還樂鄉，貌無矜色，謙沖如常，故得將士歡心。","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-058-lukang:line071:m0006","start":6,"end":7,"surface":"胤","kind":"person","person_id":"6se_002_f8d","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-058-lukang:line071:m0019","start":19,"end":20,"surface":"肇","kind":"person","person_id":"sta_dcm_n53","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-058-lukang:line071:m0024","start":24,"end":25,"surface":"抗","kind":"person","person_id":"40p_eb9_ggr","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-058-lukang:line071:m0026","start":26,"end":28,"surface":"張咸","kind":"person","person_id":"qv3_hvy_40s","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-058-lukang:line071:m0036","start":36,"end":38,"surface":"孫遵","kind":"person","person_id":"sys_aqo_3w7","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-058-lukang:line071:m0042","start":42,"end":43,"surface":"祜","kind":"person","person_id":"cys_s5z_uqq","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-058-lukang:line071:m0047","start":47,"end":49,"surface":"留慮","kind":"person","person_id":"ikz_jyo_pi2","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-058-lukang:line071:m0054","start":54,"end":56,"surface":"朱琬","kind":"person","person_id":"42h_18z_xd6","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-058-lukang:line071:m0057","start":57,"end":58,"surface":"胤","kind":"per